---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<section class="ky-final">
	<h2>Give your agents somewhere to live</h2>
	<p>
		Fifteen minutes from an empty cluster, or a k3d one-liner, to a fleet
		console with a live agent. No cloud account required.
	</p>
	<div class="ky-actions">
		<a class="ky-btn ky-btn-primary" href={`${base}getting-started/quickstart/`}>Read the quickstart</a>
		<a class="ky-btn ky-btn-secondary" href="https://github.com/matty-v/kyber">Star on GitHub</a>
	</div>
</section>
